{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22608","headline":"长安早春旅怀 · 白居易","name":"长安早春旅怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轩车歌吹諠都邑，中有一人向隅立。\n夜深明月卷帘愁，日暮青山望乡泣。\n风吹新绿草芽坼，雨洒轻黄柳条湿。\n此生知负少年春，不展愁眉欲三十。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22608.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22608","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}